# Vault key files (`A-05`). `dev/data/` already covers the development one; this catches a key
# generated under any other data directory. Committing one would publish every stored
# monitored-device credential to whoever can read the repository.
vault.key
*.vault.key

# A soak in progress writes here once a minute for 24 hours (H-01). The finished run is
# committed deliberately, with its report; a half-written one is not a measurement.
